Graphify
--------

Coodra can install and manage a local Graphify MCP runtime for code graph
queries. Graphify is an independent third-party open-source project and is not
owned by Matrix Maven.

Upstream project: https://github.com/Graphify-Labs/graphify
Python package used by Coodra: `graphifyy[mcp]`

